<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-076-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.404772" lon="-120.880612"><name>SC26-076-C</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.6 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 37/100; not catch probability. Center 47 ft; nearby 43–59 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Subtle local relief in the rendered grid; primarily a mapped-bottom investigation option. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-056</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.406010840476185" lon="-120.88184594654662"/><trkpt lat="35.404841385688144" lon="-120.88198666118015"/><trkpt lat="35.40465151806782" lon="-120.88144109486912"/><trkpt lat="35.40410701626532" lon="-120.8812351354063"/><trkpt lat="35.40399952401334" lon="-120.88024699432604"/><trkpt lat="35.404992627671454" lon="-120.88033109087853"/><trkpt lat="35.40498103288073" lon="-120.87967074991172"/><trkpt lat="35.40569801863682" lon="-120.87943174847513"/><trkpt lat="35.40553133435027" lon="-120.88020687332587"/><trkpt lat="35.40517090842722" lon="-120.88021631383356"/><trkpt lat="35.405176704809016" lon="-120.8805464851608"/><trkpt lat="35.405897556784886" lon="-120.88052760691338"/><trkpt lat="35.405728934088614" lon="-120.88119267387859"/><trkpt lat="35.40591107852734" lon="-120.88129801389303"/><trkpt lat="35.406010840476185" lon="-120.88184594654662"/></trkseg></trk></gpx>
